LICENCE NOT YET SET
===================

This file is a placeholder. The licence that applies to this tool as a derived
work has not been decided and must be set by the responsible technical unit
before the site is published.

Points to settle:

1. The substantive content is drawn from WHO publications, which are generally
   released under CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 IGO. That licence carries a share-alike
   obligation which would normally propagate to this tool.

2. The embedded checklist (assets/downloads/) and the publication cover images
   reproduced in the WHO Publications tab carry WHO branding. Confirm with
   whoever handles institutional identity that their reproduction here, and in
   any country adaptation, is acceptable.

3. If countries are expected to adapt the tool, the licence should say so
   explicitly, and state what attribution an adapted version must carry.

Replace the whole of this file with the chosen licence text.
